p.src:
The proposed mechanism is qualitative: $\text{skill}+\text{relocation}+\text{opportunity density}
\Rightarrow
\text{more chances for contact, commerce, and motivation}.$ Location does not guarantee success. It changes what one sees, who one meets, and what kinds of opportunities are normal enough to be pursued.

